<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in heavy trading Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 39.50 to 6081.18.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 3.36 to 378.43, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.36.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 1447 to 945.</p>
<p>Volume was 486,047,400, compared with 391,045,410 Monday.</p>
